{"lines":[{"c":1,"x":-0.0012135451820657057,"y":0.0015333713930562043,"w":0.3140126546223958,"h":0.045515689456005703,"t":"@MirsIELTS"},{"x":0.68133565068955393,"w":0.23483118693033866,"c":1,"h":0.0209249310788856,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.040215565489932215},{"x":0.080082134069552821,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","c":1,"y":0.089970501677551495,"h":0.021948102652850743,"w":0.35728953043619793},{"c":1,"h":0.018746210058881774,"x":0.080014843548915832,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","y":0.1259055828509823,"w":0.69211079915364582},{"c":1,"x":0.078028734893793042,"y":0.15398230109156363,"t":"Today there are a lot of different shops Where we can buy all kind of stuff produced all over the","h":0.018982814687543148,"w":0.80903493245442704},{"y":0.1731073394750553,"w":0.82356643676757812,"h":0.021965465714446242,"x":0.077958414545693036,"c":1,"t":"world. Is it right to buy food produced in other countries? Is this idea useful for people nowadays?"},{"c":1,"y":0.20348837258725938,"h":0.018930506073268183,"t":"I suppose this to be a good idea. When supermarkets and even small shops provide people food","x":0.078028753671930531,"w":0.79876795450846361},{"h":0.0189356519760987,"x":0.078028748019180319,"t":"from abroad then there are much more possibilities for us to choose something. When shops have","y":0.22383720979674693,"c":1,"w":0.82135523478190098},{"x":0.077946611625226869,"y":0.24312199232513887,"h":0.021938356607712706,"w":0.81741846720377609,"c":1,"t":"only food and things produced in our country, it is really hard to make a good choise. Sometimes"},{"x":0.078028754173688528,"t":"people want to try something new and interesting maybe even something extraordinary which they","y":0.26598837258767938,"c":1,"w":0.81519505818684901,"h":0.018967379229610337},{"c":1,"x":0.07802875956184048,"w":0.7843942260742186,"h":0.017497598878753573,"y":0.2863372093258838,"t":"never buy before. In this cases food which is produced in other countries will help them to be"},{"w":0.79055440266927079,"x":0.07802875339322024,"t":"satisfied with their demands. When supermarkets have a good suply of different food produced","y":0.30668604700625601,"h":0.018977669909992056,"c":1},{"y":0.32703488421513793,"w":0.82135523478190087,"h":0.018982814687543148,"c":1,"x":0.078028748033002276,"t":"anywhere than people can find delicious things depending on their tastes. For example, people who"},{"t":"like French products can buy some kinds of french cheese or wine not only in France.","y":0.34738372142435137,"x":0.078028738451114632,"h":0.018987959465094351,"c":1,"w":0.72073923746744795},{"t":"Food from other countries is also very good when you want to buy some fresh vegetables and fruits","x":0.080082142779770507,"w":0.83162216186523419,"h":0.018947656457051321,"y":0.37640118025259317,"c":1},{"y":0.39675516270933986,"h":0.020396000234778389,"x":0.078028741096077853,"c":1,"t":"in winter. It is really useful thing because some people are vegetarians and they need vegetables","w":0.80287475585937507},{"c":1,"x":0.078028743474768972,"y":0.41858407028970057,"w":0.27926078796386722,"h":0.018915929203539905,"t":"and fruits during the whole year."},{"w":0.78644765218098955,"h":0.018970810206590527,"y":0.44622093072700397,"t":"The only disadvantage of food which is produced in other countries is the way how it has been","x":0.078028740545561651,"c":1},{"w":0.75770019531249999,"c":1,"h":0.01897595498414173,"t":"delivered. in some cases products can be not so fresh especialy in summer, when it is very","x":0.078028752337310811,"y":0.46656976793578497},{"w":0.10400531768798829,"h":0.019467637953856642,"c":1,"t":"hot outside.","x":0.077460061449194012,"y":0.48529741962080952},{"t":"To sum it up, I can surely say that buying products from other countries is a good thing to become","w":0.82956878662109368,"y":0.51592920314434965,"h":0.018954517285732386,"c":1,"x":0.078028748279489649},{"h":0.020919130263426955,"c":1,"y":0.53575586254670449,"t":"more closer to other culturies. You can certainly cook something unusial at home and it will taste","x":0.080013156349584447,"w":0.81329198201497377},{"t":"like in very good expensive restaurant somewhere abroad.","y":0.55278252228758906,"x":0.0777721456155787,"h":0.02545396472852135,"c":1,"w":0.4850531514485677},{"y":0.59204455532773126,"w":0.31441457112630211,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.079970488477098103,"h":0.01701644121018131,"c":1},{"w":0.78439422607421871,"y":0.62936046523193712,"x":0.12525668562818831,"h":0.016067263510374907,"c":1,"t":"This is a good response to the task. The candidate clearly agrees with the idea that"},{"t":"people should be able to buy international food in supermarkets. The main reason","w":0.77207392374674477,"h":0.016029532891107534,"c":1,"x":0.12525667252837214,"y":0.64680232569623963},{"x":0.12514776379806533,"w":0.7270643107096354,"c":1,"h":0.020155191562168717,"t":"given is that people want to try something [new and interesting] and different.","y":0.66299972412194275},{"x":0.12731005956045985,"c":1,"w":0.73921971638997408,"y":0.6831395349991245,"h":0.015988371857499684,"t":"Examples are given of French products and seasonal produce for vegetarians."},{"t":"One disadvantage is given, related to the impact of hot weather on transportation.","h":0.019270225682441411,"c":1,"w":0.77013834635416678,"y":0.6994914137812831,"x":0.12724187484721475},{"h":0.017471015840153425,"c":1,"t":"The conclusion includes bringing cultures together through food but does not","x":0.12525667742189653,"y":0.71799410040829759,"w":0.72484598795572919},{"t":"summarise the points made in the full answer. A more relevant conclusion would","y":0.73539823034610985,"w":0.75564682006835948,"x":0.12525667204477098,"h":0.01605525790414275,"c":1},{"t":"help the candidate achieve a higher score, as well as further extending the ideas.","x":0.12525667867730703,"y":0.75427728617245549,"w":0.76591374715169269,"c":1,"h":0.017525039380278828},{"c":1,"x":0.12731007320437412,"w":0.76796712239583331,"y":0.7892441860700542,"t":"Generally, the candidate organises the ideas well, and we can follow them clearly.","h":0.017540474838211861},{"t":"Some good linking devices are used [where | maybe even | which | who], but some","h":0.01604925566366644,"w":0.77823410034179696,"c":1,"x":0.12731005444103469,"y":0.8081395349992051},{"x":0.12525667739522703,"w":0.72484598795572919,"c":1,"h":0.016011525044399066,"t":"errors remain [this cases \/ these cases | than \/ then]. The response is set out","y":0.82558139546392528},{"h":0.017448720678818974,"c":1,"x":0.12525667947199168,"t":"across five paragraphs, but three of them have only two sentences. These are short","w":0.79055440266927079,"y":0.84302325583752713},{"h":0.017441860412777732,"t":"paragraphs and could be extended to illustrate the central topic in more detail.","y":0.86046511629329259,"c":1,"w":0.73716634114583313,"x":0.1252566654415414},{"w":0.039014374415079711,"x":0.87679671412716254,"y":0.91860465142526271,"t":"137","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3390}